1
00:00:01,130 --> 00:00:04,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ ethereal music playing]</b></font>

2
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KENJAKU] I'm sorry.</b></font>

3
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:12,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who are you?</b></font>

4
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:16,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KENJAKU] The sorcerer
who erected the barrier here.</b></font>

5
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:18,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This spot has been chosen</b></font>

6
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:21,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for people
to kill each other in.</b></font>

7
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:25,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unfortunately,
there's no real honor in it.</b></font>

8
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:27,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kill each other?</b></font>

9
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Could you possibly find
another neighborhood</b></font>

10
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:32,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to do that in, please?</b></font>

11
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:37,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs] I didn't realize
you were such a funny kid.</b></font>

12
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:41,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's an old execution site
not too far from here.</b></font>

13
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:43,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It serves as the center
of the barrier.</b></font>

14
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:46,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It covers a five
or six-kilometer radius.</b></font>

15
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I went through great pains
to create this barrier.</b></font>

16
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:53,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I can't impose restrictions
that are too unreasonable.</b></font>

17
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anyone who was inside
the barrier when I created it</b></font>

18
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:59,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>has the right
to leave it if they want.</b></font>

19
00:01:00,790 --> 00:01:02,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But just once,</b></font>

20
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:04,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you wish right now,</b></font>

21
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:07,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you could wake up
outside the barrier.</b></font>

22
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Would you like to do that?</b></font>

23
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:12,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SASAKI]
Wake up outside the barrier?</b></font>

24
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:15,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is this a dream?</b></font>

25
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:20,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The space between dreams
and reality is a curse.</b></font>

26
00:01:25,190 --> 00:01:26,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So be careful.</b></font>

27
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:28,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Easy, take it slowly.</b></font>

28
00:01:28,890 --> 00:01:32,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The most impatient ones
are already outside waiting.</b></font>

29
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:34,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

30
00:01:52,010 --> 00:01:53,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

31
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:00,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, right.</b></font>

32
00:02:00,490 --> 00:02:02,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I nearly forgot
to tell you this.</b></font>

33
00:02:04,090 --> 00:02:06,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you for being friends
with my son.</b></font>

34
00:02:06,330 --> 00:02:07,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I appreciate it.</b></font>

35
00:02:08,330 --> 00:02:09,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[IGUCHI] Sasaki!</b></font>

36
00:02:10,130 --> 00:02:11,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sasaki!</b></font>

37
00:02:11,630 --> 00:02:13,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Sasaki!
-[gasps]</b></font>

38
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:15,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SASAKI] Iguchi!</b></font>

39
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

40
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:19,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm so glad
to see someone I know.</b></font>

41
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:24,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where are we?</b></font>

42
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:28,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Somewhere between Kotodai
and Hirose Street.</b></font>

43
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:30,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Never mind that. Look.</b></font>

44
00:02:30,180 --> 00:02:31,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's your opinion,</b></font>

45
00:02:32,050 --> 00:02:33,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as an occult club member?</b></font>

46
00:02:34,050 --> 00:02:35,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wow, uh...</b></font>

47
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:37,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exhales]</b></font>

48
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:43,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can I tell you
about a dream I had?</b></font>

49
00:02:44,130 --> 00:02:45,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[IGUCHI] We all had it.</b></font>

50
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A guy with long hair
and a kasaya, right?</b></font>

51
00:02:48,070 --> 00:02:49,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!</b></font>

52
00:02:49,470 --> 00:02:51,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did he also thank you for
being friends with his son?</b></font>

53
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:54,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm. No, that's the first time
I heard about that.</b></font>

54
00:02:58,780 --> 00:02:59,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Itadori?</b></font>

55
00:03:03,220 --> 00:03:05,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

56
00:04:33,570 --> 00:04:34,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] For real?!</b></font>

57
00:04:35,010 --> 00:04:37,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Someone was able to seal Gojo?</b></font>

58
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA, MEGUMI, YUJI] For real.</b></font>

59
00:04:41,210 --> 00:04:42,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] Damn!</b></font>

60
00:04:42,850 --> 00:04:45,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Also, this might be a bad time
to tell you this,</b></font>

61
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:47,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but the principal is dead.</b></font>

62
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:53,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How long have you known?</b></font>

63
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:55,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry
for not telling you sooner,</b></font>

64
00:04:55,330 --> 00:04:56,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it's true.</b></font>

65
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:59,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's all right though, Itadori.</b></font>

66
00:04:59,330 --> 00:05:00,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It wasn't in Shibuya.</b></font>

67
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He fought
with the higher-ups after that.</b></font>

68
00:05:03,570 --> 00:05:05,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, that doesn't
make it any better, you know.</b></font>

69
00:05:06,070 --> 00:05:08,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, after all,
the principal was like your--</b></font>

70
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:11,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, that's what I meant by,
"It's all right, Itadori."</b></font>

71
00:05:11,980 --> 00:05:12,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that's nice of you.</b></font>

72
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:15,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, if you say
you're all right, then fine.</b></font>

73
00:05:15,780 --> 00:05:17,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's nothing more
for us to add.</b></font>

74
00:05:17,420 --> 00:05:18,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

75
00:05:19,550 --> 00:05:21,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Still, you're talking
about everyone</b></font>

76
00:05:21,450 --> 00:05:22,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who's ever been good to me.</b></font>

77
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't been this bummed out</b></font>

78
00:05:24,790 --> 00:05:27,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>since I watched Yakul get shot
in the ass with an arrow.</b></font>

79
00:05:28,060 --> 00:05:30,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA, MEGUMI, YUJI]
What a nice life you've lived.</b></font>

80
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:31,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] All right, then,</b></font>

81
00:05:31,970 --> 00:05:34,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm gonna help you all
stop this Culling Game.</b></font>

82
00:05:34,830 --> 00:05:36,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Megumi sighs]
-[Yuji chuckles]</b></font>

83
00:05:37,270 --> 00:05:38,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI]
Don't get me wrong, though.</b></font>

84
00:05:38,670 --> 00:05:40,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not doing this
out of sympathy.</b></font>

85
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:44,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're cutting a deal here.</b></font>

86
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:45,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Understand me?</b></font>

87
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:47,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once we clean up
this Culling Game for you,</b></font>

88
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:50,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's gonna be your turn
to help me out with something.</b></font>

89
00:05:50,450 --> 00:05:51,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] You're trying
to get in on the revisions</b></font>

90
00:05:51,990 --> 00:05:54,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the Jujutsu Regulations,
right?</b></font>

91
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now that the existence
of curses has gone public,</b></font>

92
00:05:57,560 --> 00:06:00,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's sure to be some kind
of revisions made.</b></font>

93
00:06:01,630 --> 00:06:03,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But what exactly
are you hoping for?</b></font>

94
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Whatever it is,</b></font>

95
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:08,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I doubt we'll have much trouble
doing it for you.</b></font>

96
00:06:08,470 --> 00:06:09,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, yeah?</b></font>

97
00:06:09,500 --> 00:06:11,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Get a load of Sea Urchin Head.</b></font>

98
00:06:11,270 --> 00:06:13,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What would you know
about anything?</b></font>

99
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:15,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well...</b></font>

100
00:06:15,980 --> 00:06:17,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am the new head
of the Zen'in clan.</b></font>

101
00:06:19,610 --> 00:06:21,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Oh, yeah?
-Oh. Huh?</b></font>

102
00:06:23,620 --> 00:06:25,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI]<i>Wait, wait,
<i>wait, wait, wait, for real?</i></i></b></font>

103
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>Of the three crazy things
<i>I learned today,</i></i></b></font>

104
00:06:27,690 --> 00:06:29,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>this one's the craziest!</i></b></font>

105
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:31,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>If I got the backing of
<i>one of the big three families,</i></i></b></font>

106
00:06:31,990 --> 00:06:34,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>I could easily
<i>influence the revisions</i></i></b></font>

107
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:35,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>to the regulations.</i></b></font>

108
00:06:35,530 --> 00:06:37,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>The only problem
<i>would come later,</i></i></b></font>

109
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:39,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>in trying
<i>to keep the Zen'in clan</i></i></b></font>

110
00:06:39,100 --> 00:06:41,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>from getting involved
<i>in managing the fight club.</i></i></b></font>

111
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:43,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sea Urchin Head!</b></font>

112
00:06:43,140 --> 00:06:44,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Name's Fushiguro.</b></font>

113
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fushiguro!</b></font>

114
00:06:49,710 --> 00:06:51,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, let's be friends.</b></font>

115
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:52,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-[MEGUMI] Sure.</b></font>

116
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:59,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good. That just leaves deciding
who's heading to which colony.</b></font>

117
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuta went to Miyagi, right?</b></font>

118
00:07:01,050 --> 00:07:01,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ding-dong.</b></font>

119
00:07:02,090 --> 00:07:04,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ding-dong, ding-dong,
ding-dong, ding-dong!</b></font>

120
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:06,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please be advised!</b></font>

121
00:07:06,630 --> 00:07:09,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Effective immediately,
a player has added a new rule</b></font>

122
00:07:09,530 --> 00:07:10,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the Culling Game.</b></font>

123
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:11,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Rule number nine.</b></font>

124
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Players will know
each other's information.</b></font>

125
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:16,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>First names, last names,
<i>number of points accumulated,</i></i></b></font>

126
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>current colony,
<i>and number of rules</i></i></b></font>

127
00:07:18,470 --> 00:07:19,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>added to the game by you.</i></b></font>

128
00:07:21,010 --> 00:07:22,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am Kogane.</b></font>

129
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:25,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A liaison between players
and the Culling Game.</b></font>

130
00:07:25,850 --> 00:07:28,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did that thing just change
personalities halfway through?</b></font>

131
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The first part
was an announcement</b></font>

132
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:31,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the Culling Game.</b></font>

133
00:07:31,850 --> 00:07:34,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And now, I am speaking
as the personal liaison</b></font>

134
00:07:34,820 --> 00:07:37,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>attached to the player
Yuji Itadori.</b></font>

135
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:41,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tengen did say
something about that.</b></font>

136
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:43,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's here for you?</b></font>

137
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:45,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why is Itadori
already being counted</b></font>

138
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:46,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as one of the players
in the game?</b></font>

139
00:07:46,930 --> 00:07:49,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aside from those,
Kenjaku gave cursed techniques</b></font>

140
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:50,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and objects to--</b></font>

141
00:07:50,700 --> 00:07:52,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At this point,
the only players should be those</b></font>

142
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:54,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who have entered a colony.</b></font>

143
00:07:55,140 --> 00:07:57,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SUGURU] There were people whom
I had absorbed cursed objects...</b></font>

144
00:07:57,380 --> 00:07:58,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The cursed objects
that I distributed</b></font>

145
00:07:58,910 --> 00:08:00,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are what's left
of the sorcerers...</b></font>

146
00:08:00,350 --> 00:08:02,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course, I forged pacts
with more than just sorcerers.</b></font>

147
00:08:02,980 --> 00:08:05,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>But he once existed as
<i>an actual human being,</i></i></b></font>

148
00:08:05,890 --> 00:08:07,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>although it was
<i>over a thousand years ago.</i></i></b></font>

149
00:08:07,890 --> 00:08:10,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUJI] Sukuna.
-[KINJI] Sukuna?</b></font>

150
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:12,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sukuna was one of the sorcerers</b></font>

151
00:08:12,390 --> 00:08:15,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that forged a pact with Kenjaku
to become cursed objects.</b></font>

152
00:08:16,060 --> 00:08:17,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
<i>I bet Culling Game participation</i></b></font>

153
00:08:17,900 --> 00:08:19,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>was included in their pact.</i></b></font>

154
00:08:19,830 --> 00:08:21,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Things still aren't adding up.</b></font>

155
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:24,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You swallowed Sukuna's finger
of your own free will.</b></font>

156
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:26,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I witnessed it.</b></font>

157
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:27,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

158
00:08:29,110 --> 00:08:30,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm. Table that.</b></font>

159
00:08:31,610 --> 00:08:32,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Itadori,</b></font>

160
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>can you have Kogane pull up
the players' information for me?</b></font>

161
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:39,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kogane, can you?</b></font>

162
00:08:39,250 --> 00:08:40,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure can!</b></font>

163
00:08:40,990 --> 00:08:42,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ta-da!</b></font>

164
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:47,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take a look at this guy.</b></font>

165
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:50,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So he originally had 200 points?</b></font>

166
00:08:50,660 --> 00:08:53,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder what he was
hoping for by adding a rule.</b></font>

167
00:08:53,370 --> 00:08:55,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] At the very least,
he must have killed</b></font>

168
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:57,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about 40 people, right?</b></font>

169
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:59,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whatever the reason,
we can assume it wasn't nice.</b></font>

170
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It can still help.</b></font>

171
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We could use the player's info</b></font>

172
00:09:02,580 --> 00:09:03,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to progress
through the Culling Game</b></font>

173
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:05,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without killing anyone.</b></font>

174
00:09:05,910 --> 00:09:08,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kogane, can you show me
a list of the players</b></font>

175
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with 100 points or more?</b></font>

176
00:09:10,650 --> 00:09:14,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, I am attached
to the player, Yuji Itadori.</b></font>

177
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:15,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Oh. No, he can use you.</b></font>

178
00:09:15,990 --> 00:09:17,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just do whatever he asks.</b></font>

179
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:22,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unless someone's in a rush
to escape the barrier,</b></font>

180
00:09:22,830 --> 00:09:25,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like Tsumiki,
who got caught up in it,</b></font>

181
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:27,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the reincarnated sorcerers</b></font>

182
00:09:27,530 --> 00:09:29,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>must have forged
pacts with Kenjaku</b></font>

183
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:30,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for their own reasons.</b></font>

184
00:09:30,900 --> 00:09:33,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So they're not necessarily
motivated to make this move.</b></font>

185
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:35,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Therefore,
if there's anyone else</b></font>

186
00:09:35,710 --> 00:09:38,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with an excess of 100 points
like Kashimo...</b></font>

187
00:09:38,450 --> 00:09:39,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's right.</b></font>

188
00:09:39,950 --> 00:09:41,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Those with 100 points,</b></font>

189
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:43,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and no intention
of adding a rule.</b></font>

190
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, we can lean on them.</b></font>

191
00:09:45,220 --> 00:09:46,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And make them add a rule</b></font>

192
00:09:46,150 --> 00:09:48,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to let Tsumiki
escape the Culling Game.</b></font>

193
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:49,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here you go.</b></font>

194
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] There's another one.</b></font>

195
00:09:53,290 --> 00:09:54,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-All right!
-Yes!</b></font>

196
00:09:54,590 --> 00:09:57,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First, we'll take advantage
of the Rule Eight obstacle.</b></font>

197
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

198
00:09:58,700 --> 00:10:00,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Remind me
what Rule Eight was again?</b></font>

199
00:10:01,230 --> 00:10:03,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]<i>Players who
<i>don't show a change in points</i></i></b></font>

200
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>within 19 days</i></b></font>

201
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:06,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>shall be stripped
<i>of their technique.</i></i></b></font>

202
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:08,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>It's the rule
<i>that leads to death.</i></i></b></font>

203
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>So we add a rule that says,</i></b></font>

204
00:10:10,110 --> 00:10:12,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>"It is now possible
<i>for players to transfer points</i></i></b></font>

205
00:10:12,550 --> 00:10:13,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>among each other."</i></b></font>

206
00:10:14,350 --> 00:10:17,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>That way, if they keep passing
<i>points amongst themselves,</i></i></b></font>

207
00:10:17,220 --> 00:10:20,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>they can avoid being stripped
<i>of their techniques and dying.</i></i></b></font>

208
00:10:20,990 --> 00:10:22,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then we add one more.</b></font>

209
00:10:22,690 --> 00:10:24,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>The rule will sound
<i>something like,</i></i></b></font>

210
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>"If players spend enough points,</i></b></font>

211
00:10:26,130 --> 00:10:27,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>it will allow them to
<i>leave the Culling Game."</i></i></b></font>

212
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:29,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that would conflict
with the rule</b></font>

213
00:10:30,030 --> 00:10:32,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about the continuation
of the game, wouldn't it?</b></font>

214
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then we find a workaround.</b></font>

215
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:35,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How 'bout we add some kind</b></font>

216
00:10:35,770 --> 00:10:37,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of flexible condition
to the rule?</b></font>

217
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:40,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like dragging in a non-player
to the game to take their place?</b></font>

218
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:41,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] That could work.</b></font>

219
00:10:41,980 --> 00:10:44,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Would Kogane be
making the call on that?</b></font>

220
00:10:44,380 --> 00:10:47,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Either way,
we know what we need to do now.</b></font>

221
00:10:47,710 --> 00:10:48,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Yeah.</b></font>

222
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:50,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>While we're searching
<i>for the Angel to break</i></i></b></font>

223
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>the Prison Realm's seal...</i></b></font>

224
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:55,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we'll look for Hajime Kashimo</b></font>

225
00:10:56,690 --> 00:10:57,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and Hiromi Higuruma...</b></font>

226
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:00,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>and hunt them down.</i></b></font>

227
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:05,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I'm not seeing an "Angel"
anywhere on this list.</b></font>

228
00:11:06,030 --> 00:11:07,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] That's probably
not her real name.</b></font>

229
00:11:08,030 --> 00:11:10,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just like you're not listed
as Sukuna.</b></font>

230
00:11:10,170 --> 00:11:11,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grumbles]</b></font>

231
00:11:11,300 --> 00:11:13,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Tengen said
she was in eastern Tokyo.</b></font>

232
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:16,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That would mean
Colony Number Two, then.</b></font>

233
00:11:17,180 --> 00:11:19,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] You guys know
what she looks like?</b></font>

234
00:11:19,750 --> 00:11:21,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Apparently,
we'll know her when we see her.</b></font>

235
00:11:21,750 --> 00:11:23,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That sounds like a load of crap.</b></font>

236
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:25,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But okay, whatever, I guess.</b></font>

237
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:27,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Panda and I will
take Tokyo Number Two.</b></font>

238
00:11:27,950 --> 00:11:29,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fushiguro and Itadori,
Number One,</b></font>

239
00:11:30,020 --> 00:11:32,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and Kirara,
standby outside the barriers.</b></font>

240
00:11:32,530 --> 00:11:34,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Why?
-[KINJI] 'Cause I said so.</b></font>

241
00:11:34,830 --> 00:11:35,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] What's your reasoning?</b></font>

242
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just going by points,</b></font>

243
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:38,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this Kashimo's
the strongest one,</b></font>

244
00:11:39,070 --> 00:11:40,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so it makes sense
for me to take him on.</b></font>

245
00:11:41,070 --> 00:11:42,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm, it’s not fair I'm left out.</b></font>

246
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:44,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] Panda,
you've got a keen nose,</b></font>

247
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:46,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so focus on
sniffing out the Angel.</b></font>

248
00:11:46,570 --> 00:11:48,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The fact that we haven't
already heard from Okkotsu</b></font>

249
00:11:48,710 --> 00:11:52,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>means we probably can't use
cell phones inside the barriers.</b></font>

250
00:11:52,110 --> 00:11:54,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So that's why we need
someone keeping tabs</b></font>

251
00:11:54,410 --> 00:11:55,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on what's going on outside.</b></font>

252
00:11:55,820 --> 00:11:57,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs] Fine.</b></font>

253
00:11:57,220 --> 00:11:58,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait a minute.</b></font>

254
00:11:58,380 --> 00:12:00,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It might be better for me
and Fushiguro to split up.</b></font>

255
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:02,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-'Cause if Sukuna--
-Shut up.</b></font>

256
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:04,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Shut up"?</b></font>

257
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:07,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>None of the older students
can change the roles they got.</b></font>

258
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:09,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So quit being selfish.</b></font>

259
00:12:09,260 --> 00:12:10,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm being selfish?</b></font>

260
00:12:10,630 --> 00:12:12,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm the one
worrying about you here!</b></font>

261
00:12:12,870 --> 00:12:15,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, man, how many times
do I have to listen to this?</b></font>

262
00:12:15,370 --> 00:12:17,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a played excuse.
And a waste of time.</b></font>

263
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Yeah?!
-Yeah!</b></font>

264
00:12:19,470 --> 00:12:21,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You gonna fight or dance?</b></font>

265
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hello, I am Kogane!</b></font>

266
00:12:24,510 --> 00:12:28,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Taking place inside this barrier
is the Culling Game,</b></font>

267
00:12:28,210 --> 00:12:30,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where players fight
to the death!</b></font>

268
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:32,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once you decide to step inside,</b></font>

269
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:33,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you, too, become a player.</b></font>

270
00:12:34,090 --> 00:12:37,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you still willing to enter
and risk everything you have?</b></font>

271
00:12:37,590 --> 00:12:38,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Yeah!
-Hmm!</b></font>

272
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:39,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's go.</b></font>

273
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:45,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HANYU]<i>Hanyu to Amai.</i></b></font>

274
00:12:47,770 --> 00:12:49,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>I keep waiting for your signal.</i></b></font>

275
00:12:50,470 --> 00:12:52,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI] Uh, well, I hear you,</b></font>

276
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:54,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but there's no signal to give.</b></font>

277
00:12:54,270 --> 00:12:56,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't do much
if no one shows up.</b></font>

278
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[HANYU] What?
-[gasps]</b></font>

279
00:12:59,010 --> 00:13:00,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That little punk.</b></font>

280
00:13:00,810 --> 00:13:03,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Mouthing off to me now?
-[thuds]</b></font>

281
00:13:03,250 --> 00:13:05,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No! Please.</b></font>

282
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:07,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look, I'm sorry, really!</b></font>

283
00:13:08,050 --> 00:13:10,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HANYU] If you're
getting all high and mighty...</b></font>

284
00:13:12,430 --> 00:13:13,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll pull you down.</b></font>

285
00:13:13,660 --> 00:13:14,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ thrilling music playing]</b></font>

286
00:13:14,890 --> 00:13:16,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] We need
to be careful of the sorcerers</b></font>

287
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who've reincarnated.</b></font>

288
00:13:17,260 --> 00:13:18,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] My thoughts exactly.</b></font>

289
00:13:19,870 --> 00:13:22,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But just in case I've forgotten,
explain again.</b></font>

290
00:13:22,370 --> 00:13:23,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[frustrated sigh]</b></font>

291
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:25,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Some of them are
from 1,000 years ago.</b></font>

292
00:13:26,010 --> 00:13:27,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just 100
or 200 years ago,</b></font>

293
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:29,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they valued life way less.</b></font>

294
00:13:29,780 --> 00:13:31,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plus, they're sorcerers.</b></font>

295
00:13:31,210 --> 00:13:33,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>Fighting and death
<i>are common for them.</i></i></b></font>

296
00:13:33,310 --> 00:13:35,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>Some may want to die fighting.</i></b></font>

297
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:38,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>That might even be why
<i>they forged a pact with Kenjaku.</i></i></b></font>

298
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:42,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I’ll bet that Higuruma
and Kashimo are past sorcerers.</b></font>

299
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't expect fair negotiations.</b></font>

300
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:47,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So then, other attacks
come from cursed spirits?</b></font>

301
00:13:47,890 --> 00:13:49,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Especially at night.</b></font>

302
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:52,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, if there are modern-day
sorcerers dragged into this</b></font>

303
00:13:52,570 --> 00:13:53,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like Tsumiki was,</b></font>

304
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:54,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they might actually be open</b></font>

305
00:13:55,070 --> 00:13:57,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to exchanging
information with us.</b></font>

306
00:13:58,970 --> 00:14:01,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hello, my name is Kogane!</b></font>

307
00:14:01,140 --> 00:14:04,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Taking place inside this barrier
is the Culling Game,</b></font>

308
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:06,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where players fight
to the death.</b></font>

309
00:14:06,110 --> 00:14:09,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once you decide to step inside,
you, too, become a player!</b></font>

310
00:14:09,350 --> 00:14:12,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you still willing to enter
and risk everything you have?</b></font>

311
00:14:13,090 --> 00:14:15,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah. Let's do this.</b></font>

312
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:18,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Megumi Fushiguro has now</b></font>

313
00:14:18,390 --> 00:14:20,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>officially joined
the Culling Game.</b></font>

314
00:14:20,190 --> 00:14:21,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Would you like
to see the rules first?</b></font>

315
00:14:22,100 --> 00:14:24,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MEGUMI] No need, I'm good.
-Boo.</b></font>

316
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:26,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MEGUMI] Itadori?
-[YUJI] Hmm?</b></font>

317
00:14:26,330 --> 00:14:29,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First, we have to gather
information on Higuruma.</b></font>

318
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:31,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ready for this?
-Yeah!</b></font>

319
00:14:34,940 --> 00:14:36,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasping]</b></font>

320
00:14:36,940 --> 00:14:38,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fushiguro's gone?</b></font>

321
00:14:38,710 --> 00:14:39,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]<i>When a player enters</i></b></font>

322
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:41,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>one of
<i>the Culling Game's barriers,</i></i></b></font>

323
00:14:41,910 --> 00:14:43,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>they're randomly teleported</i></b></font>

324
00:14:43,220 --> 00:14:45,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>to one of nine
<i>designated locations</i></i></b></font>

325
00:14:45,620 --> 00:14:47,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>where they will begin the game.</i></b></font>

326
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:49,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>It was a rule
<i>of the barriers, not included</i></i></b></font>

327
00:14:49,660 --> 00:14:52,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>in the general rules
<i>of the Culling Game.</i></i></b></font>

328
00:14:52,230 --> 00:14:55,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>And others were waiting
<i>in those nine locations.</i></i></b></font>

329
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:56,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI] Here's one!</b></font>

330
00:14:56,830 --> 00:14:58,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]<i>There's a name
<i>for players who target those</i></i></b></font>

331
00:14:58,970 --> 00:15:01,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>disoriented by this
<i>unmentioned phenomenon.</i></i></b></font>

332
00:15:02,030 --> 00:15:03,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

333
00:15:03,500 --> 00:15:04,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[glass shatters]</b></font>

334
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:07,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[glass explodes, shatters]</b></font>

335
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]<i>Newbie-hunters.</i></b></font>

336
00:15:14,010 --> 00:15:15,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HANYU]
<i>He's tougher than I thought.</i></b></font>

337
00:15:15,620 --> 00:15:17,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>That would have
<i>pulverized most guys.</i></i></b></font>

338
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:19,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>But he's still kicking.</i></b></font>

339
00:15:19,820 --> 00:15:21,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>He's no ordinary person.</i></b></font>

340
00:15:22,590 --> 00:15:23,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[explosion]</b></font>

341
00:15:26,930 --> 00:15:29,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasping]</b></font>

342
00:15:31,430 --> 00:15:33,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Darling,
let's meet up, shall we?</b></font>

343
00:15:33,830 --> 00:15:35,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[whizzes, thuds]
-[groans]</b></font>

344
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:37,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

345
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]<i>She fell pretty easily.</i></b></font>

346
00:15:39,210 --> 00:15:41,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>I need to ask her
<i>about Higuruma.</i></i></b></font>

347
00:15:41,270 --> 00:15:43,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>Then I have to find Fushiguro.</i></b></font>

348
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[propeller whirring]</b></font>

349
00:15:44,510 --> 00:15:45,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] Hanyu!</b></font>

350
00:15:46,110 --> 00:15:49,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What the hell did you do
to my woman?!</b></font>

351
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guess I can just ask him.</b></font>

352
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:54,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI]<i>Oh, no.
<i>Now Haba flew in.</i></i></b></font>

353
00:15:54,250 --> 00:15:56,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>Does that mean
<i>Hanyu was taken out?</i></i></b></font>

354
00:15:56,860 --> 00:15:59,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>I think I've seen
<i>that guy before.</i></i></b></font>

355
00:15:59,790 --> 00:16:00,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Itadori?</b></font>

356
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN] Ow, that hurt!</b></font>

357
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why did you do that to me?</b></font>

358
00:16:04,830 --> 00:16:07,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't even know
if I can stand.</b></font>

359
00:16:07,570 --> 00:16:09,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, you're the one
who attacked me.</b></font>

360
00:16:09,740 --> 00:16:10,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>Damn it!</i></b></font>

361
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:13,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>I didn't expect us
<i>to get separated that way.</i></i></b></font>

362
00:16:13,710 --> 00:16:14,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anything?</b></font>

363
00:16:15,810 --> 00:16:17,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>Nue can't find him either.</i></b></font>

364
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:20,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>This colony must be
<i>larger than Shibuya.</i></i></b></font>

365
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:22,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>We're probably
<i>over two kilometers apart.</i></i></b></font>

366
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:25,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>But we both know where to head.</i></b></font>

367
00:16:26,550 --> 00:16:28,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you know a sorcerer
named Higuruma?</b></font>

368
00:16:29,260 --> 00:16:30,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN] You men are all alike.</b></font>

369
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:32,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thinking you could
just beat a woman</b></font>

370
00:16:32,390 --> 00:16:34,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-into listening to you, but--
-[MEGUMI] Answer me.</b></font>

371
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:36,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, I know him.</b></font>

372
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:38,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Could be
a different Higuruma, though.</b></font>

373
00:16:39,030 --> 00:16:40,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mine has 100 points.</b></font>

374
00:16:41,330 --> 00:16:43,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
That's the one. Where is he?</b></font>

375
00:16:43,970 --> 00:16:45,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm?</b></font>

376
00:16:45,470 --> 00:16:46,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh!</b></font>

377
00:16:46,970 --> 00:16:48,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So that's how it is.</b></font>

378
00:16:48,910 --> 00:16:49,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whizzes, crashes]</b></font>

379
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:52,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji panting]</b></font>

380
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

381
00:16:55,150 --> 00:16:56,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Haba exclaims]</b></font>

382
00:16:57,620 --> 00:17:00,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crashing]</b></font>

383
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:02,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HABA]<i>That damn brat!</i></b></font>

384
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:05,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>Amazing physical prowess though!</i></b></font>

385
00:17:08,930 --> 00:17:10,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

386
00:17:11,930 --> 00:17:13,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]
<i>I thought I'd be in trouble</i></b></font>

387
00:17:13,270 --> 00:17:15,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>with him constantly
<i>holding higher ground</i>,</i></b></font>

388
00:17:15,330 --> 00:17:18,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>but that propeller's
<i>his only means of attack.</i></i></b></font>

389
00:17:19,710 --> 00:17:20,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whirring]</b></font>

390
00:17:27,750 --> 00:17:29,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whirring]</b></font>

391
00:17:31,250 --> 00:17:33,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both grunting]</b></font>

392
00:17:33,550 --> 00:17:34,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Haba groans]</b></font>

393
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:40,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]<i>He keeps trying
<i>to get close enough to kill me.</i></i></b></font>

394
00:17:40,190 --> 00:17:41,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>I need to fight him indoors!</i></b></font>

395
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:43,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Haba chuckles]</b></font>

396
00:17:49,270 --> 00:17:51,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[propeller approaching]</b></font>

397
00:17:56,380 --> 00:17:58,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're about to be a smoothie!</b></font>

398
00:18:00,650 --> 00:18:02,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]<i>He's turned
<i>his head towards me.</i></i></b></font>

399
00:18:02,580 --> 00:18:03,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>This is it!</i></b></font>

400
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:06,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>That woman from earlier</i>,</b></font>

401
00:18:06,750 --> 00:18:09,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>she was sturdy enough to smash
<i>through buildings with me,</i></i></b></font>

402
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:11,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>but a simple thrown object
<i>made her fall.</i></i></b></font>

403
00:18:12,390 --> 00:18:14,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>I bet their hair is the key
<i>to their cursed techniques.</i></i></b></font>

404
00:18:14,990 --> 00:18:17,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>The further away from the hair,
<i>the less sturdy they are.</i></i></b></font>

405
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:19,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>How'd they become this way?</i></b></font>

406
00:18:19,430 --> 00:18:20,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>Was it part of a pact?</i></b></font>

407
00:18:20,830 --> 00:18:23,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>But no matter
<i>how tough their hair is,</i></i></b></font>

408
00:18:23,300 --> 00:18:25,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>it's still attached
<i>to their heads!</i></i></b></font>

409
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:27,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groaning]</b></font>

410
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:31,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

411
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:37,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughing]</b></font>

412
00:18:37,750 --> 00:18:39,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Broke your fist, huh?</b></font>

413
00:18:39,420 --> 00:18:42,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's too bad!
'Cause you just lost this batt--</b></font>

414
00:18:42,460 --> 00:18:44,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[thud]
-[groans]</b></font>

415
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:49,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

416
00:18:51,430 --> 00:18:54,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't break anything,
it's just a scratch. Ow.</b></font>

417
00:18:54,570 --> 00:18:56,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN] I don't mind telling you
where to find Higuruma,</b></font>

418
00:18:56,870 --> 00:18:59,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I want you
to do me a favor in return.</b></font>

419
00:19:01,170 --> 00:19:02,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Spit it out.</b></font>

420
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:03,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Magic word?</b></font>

421
00:19:03,910 --> 00:19:05,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Say "please."</b></font>

422
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:06,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or "thank you."</b></font>

423
00:19:06,750 --> 00:19:07,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Or--
-Tell me.</b></font>

424
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:09,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine.</b></font>

425
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:15,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Will you be my knight, please?
-Sure. That's fine.</b></font>

426
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:19,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, you're no fun at all,
are you?</b></font>

427
00:19:19,390 --> 00:19:21,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't have time for this.</b></font>

428
00:19:21,230 --> 00:19:22,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So hurry up.</b></font>

429
00:19:22,330 --> 00:19:23,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And walk in front.</b></font>

430
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:25,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you even know
what a knight is?</b></font>

431
00:19:25,700 --> 00:19:28,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My knight is supposed
to protect me with his life,</b></font>

432
00:19:28,230 --> 00:19:29,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if necessary.</b></font>

433
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:32,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] I will, if you're
telling me the truth.</b></font>

434
00:19:34,970 --> 00:19:36,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, wake up.</b></font>

435
00:19:36,980 --> 00:19:40,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna ask you about
a sorcerer named Higuruma.</b></font>

436
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:41,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[approaching footsteps]
-Hmm?</b></font>

437
00:19:42,250 --> 00:19:44,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI] I... I... Itadori?</b></font>

438
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:46,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know him.</b></font>

439
00:19:48,050 --> 00:19:49,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That Higuruma guy.</b></font>

440
00:19:50,690 --> 00:19:52,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] You know
what'll happen...</b></font>

441
00:19:53,730 --> 00:19:54,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you're lying.</b></font>

442
00:19:55,490 --> 00:19:57,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>I'm not like Itadori.</i></b></font>

443
00:19:57,430 --> 00:20:00,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>I'm willing to earn those
<i>100 points on my own.</i></i></b></font>

444
00:20:00,500 --> 00:20:02,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN] You know,
I do have a name.</b></font>

445
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:04,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And that name is Remi.</b></font>

446
00:20:04,740 --> 00:20:05,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's been a while.</b></font>

447
00:20:06,070 --> 00:20:07,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you remember me?</b></font>

448
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:09,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who are you?</b></font>

449
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:11,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>How does he know my name?</i></b></font>

450
00:20:12,040 --> 00:20:13,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, sorry.</b></font>

451
00:20:13,250 --> 00:20:15,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess it was just me
who knew about you.</b></font>

452
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:17,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean,
you're famous, after all.</b></font>

453
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tiger of West Middle.</b></font>

454
00:20:19,550 --> 00:20:22,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No way! You're from my hometown?
Uh... [sighs]</b></font>

455
00:20:23,660 --> 00:20:26,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] So you're saying you're
not a sorcerer from the past?</b></font>

456
00:20:26,360 --> 00:20:27,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

457
00:20:27,830 --> 00:20:31,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why? Do these clothes
look old fashioned?</b></font>

458
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:33,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And what’s your rationale
for attacking me?</b></font>

459
00:20:34,730 --> 00:20:35,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Listen, you.</b></font>

460
00:20:36,070 --> 00:20:38,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A whole lot of average people
who weren't players</b></font>

461
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:40,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>suddenly got let out
of the colony.</b></font>

462
00:20:41,270 --> 00:20:42,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But the players like me,</b></font>

463
00:20:42,370 --> 00:20:44,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who were in the colony
from the start,</b></font>

464
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:46,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>have had to participate
in the Culling Game</b></font>

465
00:20:46,210 --> 00:20:47,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for 12 days already!</b></font>

466
00:20:48,210 --> 00:20:50,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not doing this
because I want to!</b></font>

467
00:20:50,450 --> 00:20:52,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Out here,
it's kill or be killed!</b></font>

468
00:20:55,150 --> 00:20:58,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can get killed while trying
to find a reason to fight.</b></font>

469
00:20:58,660 --> 00:21:00,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>12 days out here
has taught me that.</b></font>

470
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:04,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've seen plenty of people
drown in their power so far.</b></font>

471
00:21:04,660 --> 00:21:06,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So stop trying
to differentiate between them</b></font>

472
00:21:06,670 --> 00:21:08,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as past or present sorcerers.</b></font>

473
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:11,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]<i>So the sorcerers
<i>from the past have inspired</i></i></b></font>

474
00:21:11,870 --> 00:21:14,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>the modern-day sorcerers
<i>to go into battle mode.</i></i></b></font>

475
00:21:15,370 --> 00:21:17,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b><i>In that case,
<i>I gave Itadori bad advice.</i></i></b></font>

476
00:21:18,410 --> 00:21:19,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You sure?</b></font>

477
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:21,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What about those other two?</b></font>

478
00:21:21,110 --> 00:21:22,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You were allies, right?</b></font>

479
00:21:22,280 --> 00:21:24,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI] Nah,
I was just their gofer.</b></font>

480
00:21:24,520 --> 00:21:26,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They would have killed me
at some point.</b></font>

481
00:21:26,820 --> 00:21:27,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Wait.</b></font>

482
00:21:28,890 --> 00:21:29,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Enough blind following.</b></font>

483
00:21:30,360 --> 00:21:31,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me where we're going.</b></font>

484
00:21:31,420 --> 00:21:33,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] No way, pal.</b></font>

485
00:21:33,290 --> 00:21:34,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What guarantee do I have
you won't kill me</b></font>

486
00:21:35,030 --> 00:21:37,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>right after I tell you
where to find Higuruma?</b></font>

487
00:21:37,730 --> 00:21:38,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, I see.</b></font>

488
00:21:38,860 --> 00:21:39,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...</b></font>

489
00:21:40,070 --> 00:21:41,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI] It’s Amai. Rin Amai.</b></font>

490
00:21:42,130 --> 00:21:44,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What am I supposed to do
if you die before we get there?</b></font>

491
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:46,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] That's why!</b></font>

492
00:21:46,370 --> 00:21:48,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need you to be my knight
and protect me!</b></font>

493
00:21:49,070 --> 00:21:50,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And use my name already!</b></font>

494
00:21:50,610 --> 00:21:51,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just covering my bases.</b></font>

495
00:21:51,940 --> 00:21:54,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Amai, where exactly
can I find Higuruma?</b></font>

496
00:21:54,950 --> 00:21:56,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] Okay, fine.</b></font>

497
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:58,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll give you a rough idea
of where we're going.</b></font>

498
00:21:58,350 --> 00:21:59,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI]
The stronger people are gathered</b></font>

499
00:21:59,590 --> 00:22:01,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in what used to be
the heart of the city.</b></font>

500
00:22:01,320 --> 00:22:02,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's where
most of the supplies are.</b></font>

501
00:22:02,860 --> 00:22:04,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[REMI] Higuruma's in...
-[AMAI] Higuruma's in...</b></font>

502
00:22:05,020 --> 00:22:06,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ikebukuro.
-Shinjuku.</b></font>

503
00:22:06,590 --> 00:22:08,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Got it?
-Got it?</b></font>

504
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:12,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

505
00:23:40,620 --> 00:23:43,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIROMI]<i>I sense much
<i>potential in the Culling Game.</i></i></b></font>

506
00:23:43,590 --> 00:23:45,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]<i>Every person
<i>in this nation will die.</i></i></b></font>

507
00:23:45,590 --> 00:23:46,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE]<i>I'm sorry,</i></b></font>

508
00:23:47,030 --> 00:23:48,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-<i>but she deceived you.
-[AMAI]<i>I'm sorry, Itadori.</i></i></b></font>

509
00:23:48,990 --> 00:23:51,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]<i>A sorcerer
<i>connected to Kenjaku?</i></i></b></font>

510
00:23:51,130 --> 00:23:51,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]<i>I wanna talk.</i></b></font>

511
00:23:51,930 --> 00:23:53,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIROMI]<i>We're having a retrial.</i></b></font>

